          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 59647,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wann können wir <code>console.log()</code> verwenden, um den Wert einer Variable anzuzeigen?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Nachdem wir die <code>variable</code> erstellt haben</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Bevor wir die Variable erstellen</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Vor oder nachdem wir die Variable erstellen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nachdem wir die <code>variable</code> erstellt haben.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du setzt <code>console.log(city)</code> vor die Erstellung von <code>city</code> mit <code>const</code>. Welche Änderung zeigt den gespeicherten Wert an?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verschiebe <code>console.log(city)</code> hinter die Erstellung von <code>city</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setze <code>city</code> in <code>console.log()</code> in Anführungszeichen.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Benenne nur <code>city</code> in <code>console.log()</code> um.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verschiebe <code>console.log(city)</code> hinter die Erstellung von <code>city</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 59648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum ist dies kein String-Wert?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"New York\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Weil keine Anführungszeichen darum sind</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Weil zwischen den Wörtern ein Leerzeichen ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Weil die Wörter großgeschrieben sind</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Weil keine Anführungszeichen darum sind.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Änderung macht das gezeigte <code>New York</code> zu einem String-Wert?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"New York\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Setze <code>New York</code> in doppelte Anführungszeichen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entferne das Leerzeichen zwischen <code>New</code> und <code>York</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Schreibe beide Wörter klein</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Setze <code>New York</code> in doppelte Anführungszeichen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 59668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code das <code>=</code>-Zeichen, um der <code>spaceship</code>-Variable den String-Wert <code>\"Enterprise\"</code> zuzuweisen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spaceship = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Enterprise&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>=</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 6",
            "id": 59670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige <code>Atlanta</code> in der Konsole an.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Atlanta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console.log</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>\"Atlanta\"</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib den String <code>Atlanta</code> in der Konsole aus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Atlanta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.warn\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console.log</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code>, <code>\"Atlanta\"</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 7",
            "id": 59686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib den String-Wert in der Konsole aus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sugar, spice, and everything nice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ingredients);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sugar, spice, and everything nice\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console.log</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>ingredients</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib die gespeicherte Zutatenliste aus, nicht den Variablennamen als Text.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sugar, spice, and everything nice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ingredients);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;ingredients&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sugar, spice, and everything nice\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console.log</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code>, <code>ingredients</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 59764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1000</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum zeigt der letzte Aufruf <code>console.log(savings)</code> diesen Wert an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Er zeigt <code>1000</code>, weil dieser Wert <code>900</code> in <code>savings</code> ersetzt hat</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Er zeigt <code>1500</code>, weil dies der letzte irgendwo zugewiesene Wert ist</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Er zeigt <code>900</code>, weil eine Variable ihren ersten Wert behält</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Er zeigt <code>1000</code>, weil dieser Wert <code>900</code> in <code>savings</code> ersetzt hat.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 59768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige <code>goal</code> minus <code>milesRan</code> in der Konsole an.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>goal</code>, gefolgt von <code>-</code> und schließlich <code>milesRan</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib nach der Beschriftung aus, wie viele Meilen bis zum Wert <code>goal</code> fehlen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>goal</code>, gefolgt von <code>-</code> und schließlich <code>milesRan</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
