            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setze <code>notZero</code> darauf, ob <code>chosenNumber</code> ungleich <code>0</code> ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chosenNumber = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" notZero = chosenNumber !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(notZero);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>=</code>, gefolgt von <code>!</code> und schließlich <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
